員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p030","text":"威王二十三年，與趙王會平陸。二十四年，與魏王會田於郊。魏王問曰：「王亦有寶乎？」威王曰：「無有。」梁王曰：「若寡人國小也，尚有徑寸之珠照車前後各十二乘者十枚，奈何以萬乘之國而無寶乎？」威王曰：「寡人之所以爲寶與王異。吾臣有檀子者，使守南城，則楚人不敢爲寇東取，泗上十二諸侯皆來朝。吾臣有子者，使守髙唐，則趙人不敢東漁於河。吾吏有黔夫者，使守徐州，則燕人祭北門，趙人祭西門，徙而從者七千餘家。吾臣有種首者，使備盜賊，則道不拾遺。將以照千里，豈特十二乘哉！」梁惠王慚，不懌而去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002784","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002765","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"魏王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002765","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"梁王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002765","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"檀子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002785","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0132","start":132,"end":136,"surface":"十二諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0143","start":143,"end":144,"surface":"子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002822","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"黔夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002786","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0198","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"種首","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002787","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m030-0227","start":227,"end":230,"surface":"梁惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002765","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p031","text":"二十六年，魏惠王圍邯鄲，趙求救於齊。齊威王召大臣而謀曰：「救趙孰與勿救？」騶忌子曰：「不如勿救。」段干朋曰：「不救則不義，且不利。」威王曰：「何也？」對曰：「夫魏氏并邯鄲，其於齊何利哉？且夫救趙而軍其郊，是趙不伐而魏全也。故不如南攻襄陵以獘魏，邯鄲拔而乘魏之獘。」威王從其計。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m031-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"魏惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002765","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m031-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"齊威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m031-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"騶忌子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m031-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"段干朋","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002760","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m031-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m031-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p032","text":"其後成侯騶忌與田忌不善，公孫閲謂成侯忌曰：「公何不謀伐魏，田忌必將。戰勝有功，則公之謀中也；戰不勝，非前死則後北，而命在公矣。」於是成侯言威王，使田忌南攻襄陵。十月，邯鄲拔，齊因起兵撃魏，大敗之桂陵。于是齊最彊于諸侯，自稱爲王，以令天下。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0002","start":2,"end":6,"surface":"成侯騶忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"田忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002788","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"公孫閲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002767","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"成侯忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"田忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002788","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"成侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002759","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"田忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002788","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p035","text":"三十六年，威王卒，子宣王辟彊立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m035-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002762","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m035-0010","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"宣王辟彊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002768","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p002","text":"孟軻，騶人也。受業子思之門人。道既通，游事齊宣王，宣王不能用。適梁，梁惠王不果所言，則見以為迂遠而闊於事情。當是之時，秦用商君，富國彊兵；楚、魏用吳起，戰勝弱敵；齊威王、宣王用孫子、田忌之徒，而諸侯東面朝齊。天下方務於合從連衡，以攻伐為賢，而孟軻乃述唐、虞、三代之德，是以所如者不合。退而與萬章之徒序詩書，述仲尼之意，作孟子七篇。其後有騶子之屬。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孟軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004280","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"子思","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004281","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"門人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"齊宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004282","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004282","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"梁惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m002-0061","start":61,"en